From 28f2e0ccd0c0e6c55dedc79b297df32376344d36 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lbarapat <lbarapat@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 12:25:37 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] paho-mqtt-c: add SSLSocket external signing key and
 digestsign hook

Implements the OpenSSL-side of TA-backed CertificateVerify:

- SSLSocket_makeExternalSignKey: creates a synthetic EVP_PKEY backed
  by a custom EVP_PKEY_METHOD; carries no private key material
- ext_digestsign: intercepts EVP_DigestSign BEFORE SHA-256 hashing,
  passing the raw TLS 1.3 CertificateVerify context (~130 bytes)
  to ssl_external_sign_cb; the TA hashes internally before ECDSA,
  fixing double-hash mismatch that caused server cert verify failure
- SSLSocket_createContext: loads external sign key when callback is set
  instead of loading a PEM private key file
- Add #include <glib-2.0/glib.h> for g_strlcpy (via -Dstrlcpy=g_strlcpy)
- Add #include <stdint.h> for uint16_t in signature_algorithm type

Signed-off-by: lbarapat <lbarapat@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 src/SSLSocket.c | 244 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 224 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

